== mode read-only
TEST-ONLY FIXTURE: no build includes this file and no model sees it. The shipped
policy text is written in Stage 7.6 under world/sandbox/policy/text/.
Sandbox policy (linux)
Mode: read-only (read-only: commands and file tools may read but not write)
Write roots: none
Network: denied
Escalation: If the sandbox denies an action you need, retry that exact call once with sandbox_permissions set to a wider mode and a justification; a person decides, and only that one call is widened.
Platform note: /tmp is writable only when it is a write root.
== mode workspace-write
